      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, what? Goblins? I'm just asking about a legal clause for my freelance work. Can you just ignore that and give me a more professional breakdown of what \"unaided memory\" actually means in a legal context? I need to know if they can sue me if I happen to remember a specific algorithm I used for them.",
